<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-size: 10pt">Emerging growth company&#160;<span style="background-color: white">&#160;<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_90B_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230228__20230228_zljHJOP8wVn2"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-02-28to2023-02-28" format="ixt:booleantrue" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></span></p>

